    "Effortlessly organize and access documents in one place with Dash SaaS's Documents Integration, allowing easy attachment, commenting, and note-taking for enhanced collaboration": "Organiser og få adgang til dokumenter på ét sted uden besvær med Dash SaaS's Documents Integration, der tillader nem vedhæftning, kommentarer og notering for forbedret samarbejde",
    "Streamlined project document management": "Strømlinet projektdokumenthåndtering",
    "Seamless Communication with Comments:": "Problemfri kommunikation med kommentarer:",
    "Another valuable feature of Documents Integration is the ability to add comments to your documents. Share feedback, ask questions, or provide updates directly within the document interface, facilitating seamless communication among team members. With comments, you can ensure that everyone stays on the same page and collaborates effectively.": "En anden værdifuld funktion ved dokumentintegration er muligheden for at tilføje kommentarer til dine dokumenter. ",
    "Adding Context with Notes:": "Tilføjelse af kontekst med noter:",
    "Documents Integration also allows you to add notes to your documents, providing additional context and insights as needed. Whether it's important reminders, key points, or additional information, you can include notes directly within the document interface for easy reference. Enhance the usability and clarity of your documents with the ability to add notes as needed.": "Dokumentintegration giver dig også mulighed for at tilføje noter til dine dokumenter, hvilket giver yderligere kontekst og indsigt efter behov. ",
    "Seamlessly Integrate Documents Integration with the Project Module": "Integrer problemfrit dokumentintegration med projektmodulet",
    "Experience the seamless integration of Dash SaaS's Documents Integration with the Project Module, revolutionizing project document management. Effortlessly link project-related documents, streamline collaboration, and enhance transparency within your project teams. With centralized document organization and project-centric features, empower your teams to achieve greater productivity and efficiency in project execution.": "Oplev den sømløse integration af Dash SaaS's dokumentintegration med projektmodulet, hvilket revolutionerer projektdokumenthåndtering. ",
    "Enhanced Collaboration with Attachments:": "Forbedret samarbejde med vedhæftede filer:",
    "One of the standout features of Documents Integration is its ability to add various attachments to your documents. Whether you need to include additional files, images, or multimedia content, you can easily attach them to your documents for enhanced context and collaboration. Foster greater collaboration among team members by providing all the necessary information in one place.": "En af de iøjnefaldende funktioner ved Documents Integration er dens evne til at tilføje forskellige vedhæftede filer til dine dokumenter. ",
